9393   "_ITEM_CitizensClothes_TOOLTIP_+0"   "Les habits de citadin conviennent aux honnêtes citoyens."   |
9394   "_ITEM_GlovesOfDexterity_NAME_+0"   "Gants de duel"   |
9395   "_ITEM_GlovesOfDexterity_NAME_+1"   "Gants de duel"   |
