18600   "_CREDITS_+26"   "$[Guest appearance by Formatio Versengold$]$N$NWe were able to obtain the services of the famous German medieval band Versengold$N(www.versengold.de) for several in-game performances. They play three of their$Npieces in the taverns and inns of >The Guild 2 - Renaissance<.$N"   |
18601   "_CREDITS_+27"   "$[Acknowledgement (Patch 4.2)$]$N$NMany thanks to Audinity (www.audinity.com) for remastering remastering 6 pieces of our music!$N$NAlso thank you to Kinver, LordProtektor, McCoy, DarkLiz, Zbombe and M.C.$Nfor their helpful suggestions and solutions to so many stubborn bugs.$N$NAnd not to forget: Thank you also to the many fans of >The Guild 2 - Renaissance<, who$Nhave kept the game alive and have tirelessly called our attention to bugs.$N"   |
