20588   "_MEASURE_ReflectHeritage_NAME_+0"   "Reflect on Heritage"   |
20589   "_MEASURE_ReflectHeritage_TOOLTIP_+0"   "Sit upon the ancestral seat and contemplate the legacy of your dynasty. Those who have achieved true greatness may find something extraordinary."   |
20590   "_REFLECTHERIT_MUSING_+0"   "Let me look upon all that we have built..."   |
20591   "_REFLECTHERIT_FAIL_+0"   "There is still much left to accomplish... The walls whisper of unfulfilled potential."   |
20592   "_REFLECTHERIT_FAIL_+1"   "I sense an incompleteness. This palace must first become worthy of a true legacy."   |
20593   "_REFLECTHERIT_FAIL_+2"   "Not yet... The echoes of destiny demand more of me."   |
20594   "_REFLECTHERIT_SUCCESS_+0"   "At last... I feel the weight of centuries of ambition crystallized in this very moment. This dynasty shall be eternal!"   |
20595   "_REFLECTHERIT_SUCCESS_+1"   "From nothing, an empire. From dust, a dynasty that shall outlive the stars themselves."   |
20596   "_REFLECTHERIT_MUSING_+1"   "The blood of generations courses through these halls... What secrets do these stones hold?"   |
20597   "_REFLECTHERIT_ULTRA_+0"   "Every challenge conquered. Every foe vanquished. Every ambition fulfilled. I stand as the living legend of this world!"   |
20598   "_REFLECTHERIT_ULTRA_+1"   "Let the heavens bear witness! No mortal dynasty has ever risen so high. We are beyond history itself!"   |
20599   "_REFLECTHERIT_ULTRA_+2"   "What is this? An ancient chronicle, hidden beneath the family seal..."   |
20600   "_REFLECTHERIT_ULTRA_+3"   "Page after page of victories and conquests... not a single chapter left unfinished."   |
20601   "_REFLECTHERIT_ULTRA_+4"   "From these walls I have watched a dynasty shape the very fate of this land... and now its story is complete."   |
20602   "_REFLECTHERIT_GUEST_+0"   "My lord, the halls have never shone brighter. Truly, this dynasty stands above all others."   |
20603   "_REFLECTHERIT_GUEST_+1"   "Indeed! Even the merchants in distant lands speak of this house with reverence."   |
20604   "_REFLECTHERIT_TOAST_+0"   "To the dynasty! May its glory endure for a thousand years!"   |
20605   "_REFLECTHERIT_ULTRA_NOBLE_+0"   "My lord... what that scroll contains... it speaks of a dynasty that has conquered every challenge known to this world."   |
20606   "_REFLECTHERIT_ULTRA_NOBLE_+1"   "We have all witnessed it with our own eyes. There is no greater house in all the realm."   |
20607   "_REFLECTHERIT_ULTRA_SWORD_+0"   "By this blade and the blood of my ancestors - I claim what no dynasty has ever claimed! Absolute mastery over every trial, every conquest, every ambition!"   |
20608   "_REFLECTHERIT_ULTRA_SWORD_+1"   "For the dynasty! For eternity!"   |
20609   "_REFLECTHERIT_MUSING_+2"   "And now, sitting upon this seat of power, I wonder... have I truly achieved all that I set out to do?"   |
20610   "_REFLECTHERIT_SUCCESS_+2"   "Every stone of this castle, every coin in our vaults, every title we bear -- all of it, proof that this dynasty is destined for eternity."   |
